{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content pipeline/codex_memory.md'","aggregated_output":"# AdaRES_project Research Memory\r\n\r\n## Goal And Phase\r\n- Phase 1 ScanRefer mIoU >= 0.515 unmet; Phase 2 pending. Server-2 GPUs 0/1 only, one task per GPU; server-6 excluded.\r\n- Released SPFormer sparse-UNet backbone and project decoder. No validation tuning of thresholds, temperatures, weights, feature sets or fixed 30-epoch protocol.\r\n- `research_on_capacity_gap=true`; admission hard gates: diagnosis, controls, native backward, resources, independence and goal constraints.\r\n\r\n## Champion And Baseline\r\n- B1 0.5020 mIoU, Acc@0.25 0.610, Acc@0.5 0.553, spmIoU 0.467.\r\n- B4-E30 champion 0.5094, Acc@0.25 0.608, Acc@0.5 0.562, spmIoU 0.474 at epoch 27; target gap 0.0056. Epoch-20 optimizer/scheduler continuation, not a fresh matched control.\r\n- B4-E30 checkpoint: `/bak_home/songcl/Project/AdaRES_project/AdaRES_checkpoints/adares_b4_query_competition_res/20260921_210214/best.pth`.\r\n\r\n## Active Hypotheses\r\n- None admitted or due. Fixed training cohorts retain selected-versus-oracle mask headroom, but no reliable inference-time metric-aligned confidence mechanism passed gates.\r\n\r\n## Closed Or Failed Directions\r\n- B0 0.333; B2-E30 0.5058; B3 0.5014; B4 at 20 epochs 0.5070; B5 0.5030; C1-E30 0.5008; C2-E30 0.5014; F4 0.5060; D1 0.5080; H5 0.5061. No tuning-only, seed-repeat or extension-only successors.\r\n- G1 closed 30/30, best 0.4980, -0.0114 vs B4-E30. Fixed 16-scene top-1 0.47072 vs B4 0.49186; oracle 0.83308 vs B4 0.87316. No metric-target weight/label scan.\r\n- E1/F1/F2/F3 and H1-H4, J1/J2, K1/K2, L1/L2, M1/M2 rejected on their specific bounded native diagnoses; see research_work.json for stable IDs and hashes.\r\n- N1 indicator/mask gradient interference mixed at trained B4 checkpoint (four bat