uses unavailable instance labels. G1/C1 target routes already failed. No admissible mechanism.\r\n- R2 overlapping-peer confidence: oracle peer support higher 287/387 errors vs rotated peer 198/387 and plain overlap 102/387. Frozen B4-score-times-peer support mIoU 0.79612 versus B4 0.82254 on same 1660 training expressions; 650 flips and 30 strict repeat mismatches. Rejected specific propagation rule.\r\n- S1 superpoint-order reversal train64: 0/388 missed oracles more mask-stable; score averaging 0.80927 versus B4 0.82256. Rejected.\r\n- S2 local inside/outside 2D-feature permutation train64: repeat mismatch 0; post-intervention mIoU 0.80720/0.82306 versus B4 0.82256. Frozen top-two retention 0.82007 versus outside control 0.82271. Rejected specific rule. Seed-matched error-versus-correct inside-minus-outside score drops 0.02666/0.01424.\r\n- T1 strongest-overlap competitor removal train64: oracle influence higher in 216/388 material errors, but frozen selector 0.82133 versus B4 0.82256; distant-peer control unchanged. Rejected.\r\n- T2 local 3D-feature permutation train64: inside confidence drop higher in 287/388 errors, but frozen top-two selector 0.81370 versus B4 0.82256 and outside control 0.82307. Intervention changes masks (mean IoU 0.96619). Rejected.\r\n\r\n## Running And Queue\r\n- Prepared 2026-09-26 23:47 +08:00 monitor: no active/waiting/claiming tasks, capacity 2/2 vacant, admission budget 2. Targeted GPU query before T1/T2 showed GPU0/1 0% and 1 MiB each. GPU0 inference probes completed; no admission, training code, receipt, dispatch or queue mutation.\r\n- `research_work.json` contains rejected T1/T2 and bounded design-cycle stop reason with hashed evidence and concrete resume condition. `pipeline/closure_policy.json` is absent.\r\n\r\n## Open Questions And Risks\r\n- No pending questions in prepared manifest. Active queries, full-run latency and peak training memory remain unmeasured for key variants; G1/H5 terminal auxiliary metrics unavailable.\r\n- Native probes used key SSH and server-2 `adares_project` environment; local Python lacks PyTorch. T1/T2 are inference-only, not native backward or training-resource gates. Fixed training cohort is diagnostic.\r\n- Global hypothesis exhaustion is not claimed. Resume on an independently justified, inference-available mechanism with a native matched test and six gates, not renamed/tuned variants.\r\n\r\n## Last Tick\r\n- 2026-09-26 23:59 +08:00 design: prepared monitor/goal preflight used once, never rerun. T1/T2 native diagnoses and frozen selectors failed; no admission. Decision `20260926-235952_route_change.md` logged. Both project GPU slots left unqueued.\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
