{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_29","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content D:\\\\project\\\\.agents\\\\skills\\\\songcl_research_pipeline\\\\SKILL.md | Select-String -Pattern 'scp|ssh|sync|同步' -Context 2,4 | Select-Object -First 50; Get-Content pipeline/analyses/AdaRES-S1-S2_diagnosis_20260926-232500.md -TotalCount 70\"","aggregated_output":"\r\n  `D:/project/.claude/skills/songcl_research_pipeline` are historical paths, not the\r\n  current executable location. Shell launchers resolve their own directory.\r\n> The `.agents/skills` installation is a synchronized discovery copy.\r\n  \r\n  ## Executable Closure (2026-09-15)\r\n  \r\n  Projects opting in through `pipeline/closure_policy.json` use\r\n  `references/closure.md`: persistent candidate stages, hashed admission receipts,\r\n> safe ff-only synchronization, candidate-only YAML adaptation, native training\r\n  progress checks and postflight validation. `pipeline/research_work.json` pending\r\n  actions resume in event mode without waiting for a new design cycle.\r\n  Existing running experiments are not retroactively gated. Other projects keep\r\n  their existing deployment behavior until explicitly enabled.\r\n  \r\n  功能：\r\n> 1. 从 `SERVERS.yaml` 获取所有 GPU 服务器，SSH 检查训练进程（匹配 `tools/train.py`）\r\n  2. 从日志提取 mIoU 序列，计算「连续未刷新 best」计数\r\n  3. **早停**：达到 patience 自动 kill（优先级：`--patience` > 队列任务级 `patience` > 队列全局 `patience` > 10）\r\n  4. **GPU 队列**：空闲 GPU（**util<10% 且显存<1GB** 且在白名单内）自动推送下一实验\r\n  5. **白名单**：`SERVERS.yaml` 每台 gpu_server 的 `allowed_gpus` 限定可操作卡号，白名单外进程只展示不处置\r\n    - `>1`: 单卡多任务，该卡本项目任务数 < max **且** 显存余量 > 单任务需求(~20GB) 即可再推，同一 tick 可连续推满槽位\r\n    - 现有配置：cluster server-6 GPU7 = 3，multiview server-6 GPU4 = 2\r\n> - 未写 `allowed_gpus` = 不限制（兼容旧项目）；跳板机在服务器项配 `jumphost: user@host`，SSH/scp 自动走 `-J`\r\n  - **各项目当前的白名单、主训练服务器、IP 等一律以该项目 `SERVERS.yaml` 为唯一事实源**（本文件不维护快照）；跨项目总览\r\n用 `songcl_server_status` skill\r\n  - skill 本体已纳入 git 版本控制（`.claude/` 仓库），改坏可回滚。Windows: `D:/project/.claude/`；Linux: `/home/songcl/\r\n3dres/project/.claude/`\r\n  \r\n  ## 项目流水线队列文件 — `pipeline/queue.json`\r\n  - 任务级 `requires_exclusive_ownership`（可选，默认 `false`）：仅用于需要独占\r\n    GPU ownership 生命周期证明的诊断任务。普通训练不得设置此字段，仍由白名单、\r\n>   GPU 空闲/显存检查、流水线锁、代码同步和启动后 PID 验证保护。\r\n  - `status` 生命周期：`waiting → claiming → running → done_complete | done_earlystop | crashed | stopped_unknown`。终\r\n态任务会带 `final_best` / `finished_at`。\r\n  - 防误归档：running 但进程消失时，若日志 10 分钟内仍在更新则跳过终态判定（可能是重启/瞬时抖动）；终态先判\"正常完成\"再\r\n判崩溃关键字。\r\n  - 推送成功以**远端实际出现进程**为准（等 6s 后 ps 验证），不信任 remote_train.sh 的 stdout。\r\n  - resume 进程（命令行含 `--resume`）自动聚合该 config 的全部历史日志计算 Best/no_improve，防止新日志重置早停计数；从\r\n头重跑只看最新一段日志。\r\n  跨项目管理工具（如 `cluster_dashboard.py`）归入对应的 skill 目录（`.claude/skills/songcl_server_status/`）或独立脚本\r\n目录（`<project>/scripts/`）。\r\n  \r\n> ## 代码同步规则（硬性规则）\r\n  \r\n  **每次设计新变体或入队前，必须将最新代码推送到所有可用服务器**：\r\n  \r\n  ```bash\r\n  git status                      # 1. 确认本地改动已 commit\r\n  git push 2>/dev/null || true    # 2. push 到远端 git（如有）\r\n> # 3. sync 到所有 role=gpu_server 且 allowed_gpus 非空的服务器\r\n  SKILL_DIR=\"$PROJECT_ROOT/.claude/skills/songcl_research_pipeline\"\r\n> for srv in <server-list>; do PROJECT_ROOT=\"$PROJECT_ROOT\" bash \"$SKILL_DIR/pl.sh\" <project> sync $srv; done\r\n  ```\r\n  \r\n> **每次 tick 推送训练前检查本地-远端代码一致性**：已内置于 `pipeline_monitor.py` 的队列推送逻辑（对比 commit hash，不\r\n一致先 sync 再推送）。\r\n  \r\n  ## 统一输出格式 — Tick 报告（硬性规则）\r\n  \r\n> - 每次 tick 写 `pipeline/reports/summary_<YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS>.md`；**用户前台询问状态**时现场输出同样格式并**必须同步写\r\n入** `summary_<ts>_manual.md`。\r\n  - **完整六段格式（0-5：Goal Status / GPU Overview / Running Experiments / Queue Status / This Tick's Actions / Decisi\r\nons Made），禁止精简合并为单行**，模板与逐段强制检查见 `references/formats.md#1-tick-报告`。\r\n  - 删 24h 前旧 summary。\r\n  \r\n  ## 输出产物（每项目 `pipeline/` 目录下）\r\n  SKILL_DIR=\"${PROJECT_ROOT:-D:/project}/.claude/skills/songcl_research_pipeline\"\r\n  \r\n> PROJECT_ROOT=\"$PROJECT_ROOT\" bash \"$SKILL_DIR/pl.sh\" <project> sync   <server>                                 # 推送\r\n代码\r\n  PROJECT_ROOT=\"$PROJECT_ROOT\" bash \"$SKILL_DIR/pl.sh\" <project> train  <server> <config> [gpu_ids] [num_gpus]   # 启动\r\n训练\r\n  PROJECT_ROOT=\"$PROJECT_ROOT\" bash \"$SKILL_DIR/pl.sh\" <project> resume <server> <config> <gpu_ids> [ckpt]       # 恢复\r\n训练\r\n  PROJECT_ROOT=\"$PROJECT_ROOT\" bash \"$SKILL_DIR/pl.sh\" <project> log    <server> [config]                        # 查看\r\n日志\r\n  PROJECT_ROOT=\"$PROJECT_ROOT\" bash \"$SKILL_DIR/pl.sh\" <project> kill   <server> [config]                        # 终止\r\n任务(不带 config 则列出)\r\n  - 每次手动干预后自动 `log_decision.sh` 记录（type=`manual`；用户指定下一批实验用 `manual_batch`，跳过 Phase1/2 分析直\r\n接实现+入队）\r\n  - 安全边界始终生效：白名单守卫、`.pipeline.lock` 并发锁、running.json 防双推\r\n> - 任何代码/config 修改必须 **commit + sync 到所有服务器**（check_code_sync 推送前验证）\r\n  \r\n  ## 研究决策指南 — 全自主闭环（硬性规则）\r\n  \r\n  tick 会话中 Codex 自主决策，核心原则：**不等用户、直接执行、全量落文档**。\r\n# Native diagnostic cycle: S1 and S2\r\n\r\n2026-09-26 23:25 Asia/Shanghai. Prepared monitor/goal preflight used once. Server-2 GPU0 key SSH; fixed first 64 ScanRefer training scenes, 1660 expressions, B4-E30 best checkpoint. Native read-only interventions; no training or validation tuning.\r\n\r\n## S1: Superpoint-order equivariance\r\n\r\nReverse decoder superpoint order, remap sampled seeds, and restore mask coordinates. Unchanged-input repeated readout mismatch 0. Among 388 material selection errors (oracle minus selected IoU > 0.05), missed oracle more mask-stable in 0; selected/oracle mean mask stability 1.00000/0.99849. Mean selected mask IoU across order reversal 0.99939, while same selection survived 56.51% of expressions. Frozen matched-score averaging changed 129 selections and reduced mIoU from B4 0.82256 to 0.80927; order-only confidence mIoU 0.78493. The instability is not a useful metric-aligned selector. Reject S1, no training gate.\r\n\r\n## S2: Local 2D-feature support\r\n\r\nFor each expression's selected mask, cyclically permute 2D features within its predicted superpoints; control permutes an equal number outside. Retain feature distribution and language. The final seed-matched native run yielded 0 repeated-forward mismatches, selected seed retained in 1653/1660 inside and 1660/1660 outside interventions. Inside/outside selected-mask IoU 0.96763/0.99722 and selection flips 614/54. Mean mIoU after intervention 0.80720/0.82306 versus B4 0.82256. Inside-minus-outside confidence drop was higher in 259/388 material errors; seed-matched mean difference 0.02666 for errors versus 0.01424 for correct selections. Earlier overlap-matched deltas were inflated by query reassignment and superseded. The association is not a deployable selection rule.\r\n\r\nFrozen top-two matched-confidence rule tested each query with its own inside-mask permutation. It achieved 0.82007 mIoU versus unchanged B4 0.82256 and outside-mask control 0.82271, with 150 changed outcomes. The readout does not establish a causal improvement, and the inside intervention changes masks; no confidence pathway is admitted. The 6.31 GiB inference reservation is not a backward/training resource measurement.\r\n\r\n## Gates and disposition\r\n\r\nBoth routes fail frozen diagnosis/control selection improvement. S1 and the specific S2 top-two retention rule are rejected. No native backward, training-resource qualification, independent model/config package, admission receipt, sync for training, dispatch or queue mutation. The probe scripts were copied to server-2 for read-only execution only. No global hypothesis-exhaustion claim; revisit S2 only with a predeclared inference-valid mechanism that survives an equal-area outside control and a paired native training diagnosis, not a weight/threshold/top-k scan.\r\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
